Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":3,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":440,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1917891,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":288307,"Name":"TandAGetHitched","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-288307.jpg?_r=1484509210","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1498681789,"LastPoster":{"Id":288307,"Name":"TandAGetHitched","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-288307.jpg?_r=1484509210","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":60,"Preview":{"Id":1917891,"PostDate":1498681789,"PostContent":"I know this topic is going to strike a chord with many brides\u2026 \u00a0 We are getting married in Rivier...","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"color:#696969;\"><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif;\">Cheers to Love, Laughter, and Happily Ever After<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"aleegriff@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.180.190.28","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1484507663,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-288307.jpg?_r=1484509210","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TandAGetHitched","Id":288307,"Name":"TandAGetHitched","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.250.140.90","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":81070,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b872d2eaa73ced98ff7701a625d2201f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I know this topic is going to strike a chord with many brides\u2026&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We are getting married in Riviera Maya. We decided to have no bridal party as our guests are spending a great deal of money to travel to Mexico and we don\u2019t want our friends and family to spend more on bridal party costs.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I\u2019m inviting many of my girlfriends\/sisters to join me in the bridal suite the morning of the wedding- a care-free and fun getting ready party for everyone!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I know the resort provides a day of coordinator for the wedding. What I\u2019m thinking is I may ask one of my best girlfriends to act as our day of coordinator, and be the resort\u2019s \u201cgo-to\u201d for all questions regarding our wedding. I have a very special friend in mind; she is coordinating with several other girlfriends are working together to plan the shower and bachelorette party and she keeps asking me \u201chow can I help?\u201d&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I\u2019m &lt;u&gt;not expecting&lt;\/u&gt; this person to help me pee or fetch things for me or be my \u201cbridal b*tch\u201d \u2013 I would just be asking her to make some decisions or answer questions from the resort\/guests if needed. My FI and I both totally trust this person to make decisions on our behalf and she\u2019ll ensure we don\u2019t get hit with any fees or surprises. And honestly, I can\u2019t imagine there\u2019ll be much since the resort has the whole \u2018wedding day execution\u2019 down pat.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am absolutely planning to give her an amazing gift, to thank her for her help and include her in the program. (I\u2019ve thought about paying a portion of her travel, or something similar)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I cannot handle the term \u201cpersonal attendant\u201d because she is not! She\u2019s an amazing woman who we know can make calm decisions under pressure, who is organized, super friendly and just overall amazing. She\u2019d be a Bridesmaid if we were having a bridal party, but that\u2019s not an option.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Has anyone done something like this in the past? Any ideas on what to call her?&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1917891,"PostDate":1498681789,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I know this topic is going to strike a chord with many brides\u2026<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are getting married in Riviera Maya. We decided to have no bridal party as our guests are spending a great deal of money to travel to Mexico and we don\u2019t want our friends and family to spend more on bridal party costs.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I\u2019m inviting many of my girlfriends\/sisters to join me in the bridal suite the morning of the wedding- a care-free and fun getting ready party for everyone!<\/p>\n<p>I know the resort provides a day of coordinator for the wedding. What I\u2019m thinking is I may ask one of my best girlfriends to act as our day of coordinator, and be the resort\u2019s \u201cgo-to\u201d for all questions regarding our wedding. I have a very special friend in mind; she is coordinating with several other girlfriends are working together to plan the shower and bachelorette party and she keeps asking me \u201chow can I help?\u201d<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I\u2019m <u>not expecting<\/u> this person to help me pee or fetch things for me or be my \u201cbridal b*tch\u201d \u2013 I would just be asking her to make some decisions or answer questions from the resort\/guests if needed. My FI and I both totally trust this person to make decisions on our behalf and she\u2019ll ensure we don\u2019t get hit with any fees or surprises. And honestly, I can\u2019t imagine there\u2019ll be much since the resort has the whole \u2018wedding day execution\u2019 down pat.<\/p>\n<p>I am absolutely planning to give her an amazing gift, to thank her for her help and include her in the program. (I\u2019ve thought about paying a portion of her travel, or something similar)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I cannot handle the term \u201cpersonal attendant\u201d because she is not! She\u2019s an amazing woman who we know can make calm decisions under pressure, who is organized, super friendly and just overall amazing. She\u2019d be a Bridesmaid if we were having a bridal party, but that\u2019s not an option.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Has anyone done something like this in the past? Any ideas on what to call her?<\/strong><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"color:#696969;\"><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif;\">Cheers to Love, Laughter, and Happily Ever After<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"aleegriff@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.180.190.28","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1484507663,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-288307.jpg?_r=1484509210","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TandAGetHitched","Id":288307,"Name":"TandAGetHitched","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.141.126.65","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":81070,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5ea5bae579844da202e8038c30a579e9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I think that&#039;s a great idea and if she keeps asking you how she can help, I think she would be honored to help you on the big day. &amp;nbsp;What if you told her that if you had a bridal party, she&#039;d clearly be a part of it and you were wondering if she&#039;d be your person of honor that day? &amp;nbsp;Maybe you can ask in a card so you can give a quick summary of what you&#039;re asking her to do. &amp;nbsp;Ideas of titles: &amp;nbsp;day of coordinator, right-hand lady, person of honor, best bitch, lol. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1917981,"PostDate":1501186750,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I think that's a great idea and if she keeps asking you how she can help, I think she would be honored to help you on the big day. \u00a0What if you told her that if you had a bridal party, she'd clearly be a part of it and you were wondering if she'd be your person of honor that day? \u00a0Maybe you can ask in a card so you can give a quick summary of what you're asking her to do. \u00a0Ideas of titles: \u00a0day of coordinator, right-hand lady, person of honor, best bitch, lol. \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kantisavage@gmail.com","IpAddress":"98.141.126.65","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1469470118,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287452.jpg?_r=1501173110","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kateleigh","Id":287452,"Name":"kateleigh","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.250.140.90","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":81070,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2d82fc586eb329e60d41ff525b00d299","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thanks for the ideas!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I took her to dinner and asked her if she&#039;d be my \"right-hand-lady\". She was very excited to be part of the day and all the planning. she said she was actually grateful she wasn&#039;t a bridesmaid - she&#039;s been in a lot of weddings lately and is looking forward to hanging out with me for the day, but not having just a &#039;big formal role&#039; as she called it.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I told her we need to come up with good title for her, because Personal Attendant does not fit. I told her we&#039;ll figure out the best title for her... some other ideas we had:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Best Gal&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Master of Ceremonies&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The Guide&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Day of Genius&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Right-Hand Lady&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1917982,"PostDate":1501190223,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thanks for the ideas!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I took her to dinner and asked her if she'd be my \"right-hand-lady\". She was very excited to be part of the day and all the planning. she said she was actually grateful she wasn't a bridesmaid - she's been in a lot of weddings lately and is looking forward to hanging out with me for the day, but not having just a 'big formal role' as she called it.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I told her we need to come up with good title for her, because Personal Attendant does not fit. I told her we'll figure out the best title for her... some other ideas we had:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Best Gal<\/p>\n<p>Master of Ceremonies<\/p>\n<p>The Guide<\/p>\n<p>Day of Genius<\/p>\n<p>Right-Hand Lady<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"color:#696969;\"><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif;\">Cheers to Love, Laughter, and Happily Ever After<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"aleegriff@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.180.190.28","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1484507663,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-288307.jpg?_r=1484509210","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TandAGetHitched","Id":288307,"Name":"TandAGetHitched","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"81070","Title":"Day Of Coordinator \/ Personal Attendant","LastPostDate":1501190223},"Pages":{"TotalItems":3,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}